              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Choosing the right trailer for temperature-sensitive goods is one of the most important decisions a business owner can make. Whether you haul produce, pharmaceuticals, or specialty goods across Florida, protecting that cargo is key. But how do you know if you need a full-fledged refrigerator trailer or if an insulated dry van will do the job? Let's break down the differences so you can make the right choice for your business.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-reefer-vs-insulated",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "What Sets Reefer Trailers and Insulated Dry Van Trailers Apart?",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "reefer-vs-insulated"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-reefer-vs-insulated-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "While they might look similar from the outside, <a href=\"/store/inventory?type=trailer\">refrigerator trailers</a> and <a href=\"/store/inventory?type=trailer\">insulated dry van trailers</a> serve very different purposes. Understanding their construction and capabilities helps you choose the right tool for the job.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-reefer-vs-insulated-2",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 4
                  },
                  "styles": {
                    "base": {
                      "gap": 28,
                      "marginTop": 8,
                      "marginBottom": 34
                    }
                  },
                  "children": [
