  "css": "/* Latest posts cannot leave out the post being read, so it asks for four and\n   this post's own card is hidden (or, when it is not among them, the fourth). */\n[data-bz-node=\"related-posts\"] .bz-card[href$=\"/refrigerator-trailer-or-insulated-trailer\"] { display: none; }\n[data-bz-node=\"related-posts\"] .bz-grid:not(:has(.bz-card[href$=\"/refrigerator-trailer-or-insulated-trailer\"])) > .bz-card:nth-child(n+4) { display: none; }\n\n/* The hero photograph is framed a little high, as the design frames it. */\n[data-bz-section=\"post-hero\"] [data-bz-node=\"ph-photo\"] img { object-position: center 55%; }\n\n/* Its type cards: 24px in, the title 10px over a 14px list. */\n[data-bz-node=\"art-body\"] .ss-cl--type,\n[data-bz-node=\"art-body\"] .ss-cl--type3 { gap: 24px; }\n[data-bz-node=\"art-body\"] .ss-cl--type { gap: 28px; }\n[data-bz-node=\"art-body\"] .ss-cl--type .ss-cl__card { padding: 24px; }\n[data-bz-node=\"art-body\"] .ss-cl--type .ss-cl__t { margin: 0 0 10px; }\n[data-bz-node=\"art-body\"] :is(.ss-cl--type, .ss-cl--type3) .ss-cl__list { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; }\n[data-bz-node=\"art-body\"] :is(.ss-cl--type, .ss-cl--type3) .ss-cl__list li { font-size: 14px; }\n\n/* A type card's sentence is set as body text, as the article's paragraphs are. */\n[data-bz-node=\"art-body\"] :is(.ss-cl--type, .ss-cl--type3) .ss-cl__p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 18px; }\n\n/* Its questions are ruled above each, and closed off below the last. */\n[data-bz-node=\"art-body\"] .ss-qa { margin-bottom: 20px; }\n[data-bz-node=\"art-body\"] .ss-qa__i { border-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }\n[data-bz-node=\"art-body\"] .ss-qa__i:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }\n[data-bz-node=\"art-body\"] .ss-qa__a { font-size: 15px; }\n\n[data-bz-node=\"art-body\"] [data-bz-node=\"cards-reefer-vs-insulated-2\"] .bz-block--heading h3 { margin: 0 0 10px; }\n\n[data-bz-node=\"art-body\"] > [data-bz-node=\"actions-which-one-4\"] .bz-btns { margin: 8px 0 8px; }\n"
}
